# Mystery Shack — custom Ghostty theme
#
# Generated from theme/palette.json. Do not hand-edit; edit the palette instead.
#
# Built to two published rules from Selenized (Jan Warchol), the only widely used
# theme that states its numbers:
#   - every accent sits > 33 CIELAB L* above the background   (ours: 55.1)
#   - darkest and brightest accent differ by < 20 L*          (ours:  2.7)
# Accents therefore share one OKLCH lightness, so no hue outshouts the others.
#
#   dark stained wood in shadow ... background
#   warm lamp-glow on the wall  ... foreground
#   the lantern flame           ... yellow
#   terracotta pumpkins         ... red
#   pine cones / van green      ... green
#   turquoise conchos on the hat ... cyan + blue
#   dried flowers               ... magenta

